WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Install with one line from shotfleet.com,
then check the Mac.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
shotfleet doctor --fix checks Maestro,
Java, Xcode and the Android SDK.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.700
Sped up 3x while it checks
(real time 5 s).

4
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.500
If something is missing, it shows the
plan, asks once, then downloads it.

5
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
On this Mac nothing was missing:
iOS ready, Android ready.

6
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.900
It never uses sudo.
Next step: shotfleet init.
